harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:315:- Validation drift: local tests, remote automation, CI, probes, canaries, or monitoring criteria change without threshold updates.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:316:- Handoff stagnation: open handoffs repeat failures, lack citations, or never close.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:317:- Cost/context runaway: raw logs, reports, or broad source context move into the main session instead of file-system evidence.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:324:- Create or repair a handoff.
harnessloop/plugins/harnessloop/skills/harnessloop-loop/SKILL.md:330:Use deterministic self-audit signals where possible: repeated feedback sequence, repeated next action count, scope-lock version, goal/threshold/data-contract version or hash, verification command changes, stale evidence count, open handoff age, context risk, and delegation model/effort verification.
