  1210	    innocuous relative string — from defeating every literal check that ran
  1211	    before resolution). The declared-string glob/env-character check is the
  1212	    one exception: it runs on the raw string, deliberately before
  1213	    `expanduser`/`resolve` are ever called, since a literal `*`/`$(`/`${`
  1214	    in a path meant to be used literally is suspicious independent of what
  1215	    it might canonicalize to.
