   154	    Cross-settlement-window boundary
   155	    ---------------------------------
   156	    This script is normally invoked *from inside* the very assistant message
   157	    it is reporting on (the tool call is one content block of that message),
   158	    so the marker offset routinely lands in the middle of a message's run of
   159	    lines: earlier content-block lines for the in-progress message are
