     1	# Control Contract
     2	
     3	## Auto-Continue
     4	
     5	Allowed when:
     6	
     7	- Feedback class: feedback=positive
     8	- Evidence health: 无 stale
     9	- Environment self-check: pass（见 state/environment.md）
    10	- Open handoffs: 无 open handoff 阻塞
    11	- Human confirmation: 不需要——满足以上条件时自动进入下一子目标；read-only 调查轮（runtime-recoverable）自动开启
    12	
    13	## Human Confirmation Required
    14	
    15	Required for:
    16	
    17	- Scope-lock mutation: main session 自主（版本递增留痕）；但目标解释级变更需用户
    18	- Evidence contract revision: 需用户
    19	- Control contract revision: 需用户
    20	- Failed review acceptance: 仅用户
    21	- Rollback: main session 可执行已分类错误的回滚；跨仓库回滚需用户
    22	- Irreversible or external-system write: 需用户（例外：git push 到 surebeli/harnessloop、surebeli/test-harnessloop、surebeli/hopper-plugin 与 surebeli/kata 四仓在批次验收通过后为既定授权流程，无需逐次确认；三个插件（harnessloop / hopper-plugin / kata）push 前均须同步 bump 版本信息，保持各自版本文件一致后才能 push——harnessloop 的版本 bump 已是既有发布惯例；hopper-plugin 版本文件以仓库实际布局为准：.claude-plugin/marketplace.json、package.json 及 CLI 版本串等全部一致；kata 版本文件为 plugin/.claude-plugin/plugin.json、.claude-plugin/marketplace.json、CHANGELOG.md，同样须全部一致；未 bump 版本不得 push（用户条件 2026-07-17）） (user-confirmed 2026-07-17：定位与既有两插件相同)
    23	
    24	## Stop Conditions
    25	
    26	Stop when:
    27	
    28	- Blocking condition: human-decision-required / access-missing / write-safety-required 且下一安全动作需用户输入时
    29	- Blocker type: 见下方 Blocker Classification（协议 7 类）
    30	- Missing evidence: TODO (owner: user)
    31	- Environment mismatch: TODO (owner: user)
    32	- Model/effort mismatch: TODO (owner: user)
    33	- Contract cannot be evaluated: TODO (owner: user)
    34	
    35	## Blocker Classification
    36	
    37	| Type | Continue behavior | User input required |
    38	| --- | --- | --- |
    39	| runtime-recoverable | Start read-only investigation or recovery-planning round | no |
    40	| access-missing | Stop and ask for missing access/tool facts | yes |
    41	| write-safety-required | Stop before mutation; ask for write safety and confirmation | yes |
    42	| human-decision-required | Stop and ask for decision | yes |
    43	| contract-insufficient | Repair contract before execution | maybe |
    44	| external-system-unsafe | Allow bounded observation only | maybe |
    45	| unknown | Ask for facts needed to classify | yes |
    46	
    47	协议 7 类照录；其中 runtime-recoverable 与 contract-insufficient 可自恢复（后者限契约修复动作，不得借此扩大到业务执行）。
    48	
    49	## Delegation Boundaries
    50	
    51	Allowed delegated work: 只读发现/对抗审查（Workflow 多 agent 并行）；一切写入类任务（代码/文档）委派 claude-sonnet-5 子代理
    52	
    53	Disallowed delegated work: 目标解释、breakdown 审批、scope-lock 变更、轮次验收、评审失败后的接受
    54	
    55	Required handoff evidence: 结构化摘要 + 文件路径引用（原始 diff/日志走文件与 handoff，不进主会话上下文）
    56	
    57	## Acceptance Authority
    58	
    59	Round acceptance: main session（claude-fable-5）
    60	
    61	Failed review escalation: 仅用户
    62	
    63	Blocked state unblock requirement: human-decision-required / access-missing / write-safety-required 且下一安全动作需用户输入时停止，等待用户输入解除
    64	
    65	Recoverable blocker auto-round policy: runtime-recoverable 与 contract-insufficient 可自恢复（后者限契约修复动作）；read-only 调查轮自动开启
